@startuml 智能日报生成器-用例图
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "小组成员" as Member
actor "团队负责人" as Leader
actor "配置管理员" as Admin

rectangle "智能日报生成器" {
  usecase "采集 GitHub 提交" as UC1
  usecase "采集飞书任务" as UC2
  usecase "采集飞书群消息" as UC3
  usecase "生成个人日报" as UC4
  usecase "归属协作成果" as UC5
  usecase "汇总团队日报" as UC6
  usecase "推送日报\n(邮件/飞书机器人)" as UC7
  usecase "查询历史日报" as UC8
  usecase "配置数据源凭证" as UC9
  usecase "维护成员映射" as UC10
}

Member --> UC1
Member --> UC2
Member --> UC3
Member --> UC4
Member --> UC8

UC4 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC4 : <<include>>
UC6 ..> UC7 : <<include>>

Leader --> UC6
Leader --> UC7
Leader --> UC8

Admin --> UC9
Admin --> UC10

note right of UC5
  依据提交与任务的
  关联关系自动归属
  到全部贡献者名下
end note

note bottom of UC9
  凭证一律走环境变量
  严禁写入代码或仓库
end note

@enduml
